<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hello&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Your blood drive
is coming up, and every donation is vital because hospital patients are counting
on lifesaving blood products from your drive. We are grateful for your kindness
and commitment to helping those in need.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><b>As a special thank you to donors for helping address the need for blood during the critical post-holiday time, those who come to give Jan. 1-26, 2025, will be automatically entered for a chance to win a trip for two to Super Bowl LIX.^</b></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">As you
continue the work to make your drive a success – remember to use these tips:</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin"><br></span></b></p><ul style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0in;" type="disc"><li class="MsoNormal"><b>Share the attached email</b>&nbsp;about this exciting incentive to recruit more blood donors!</li><li class="MsoNormal"><b>Fill your schedule</b>. Use these<a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/hosting-a-blood-drive/manage-my-blood-drive/blood-drive-coordinator-toolkit/tips-tools-for-recruiting-donors/coordinator-toolkit---tips-and-tools.html">&nbsp;tools</a>&nbsp;to recruit blood donors and schedule them using the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.redcrossblood.org/account-login.html">Blood Drive Management Portal</a>.</li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:
     normal"><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
     minor-latin">Encourage donors to schedule a donation for a friend</span></b><span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">.
     Each additional donor scheduled means more lives saved!</span></li></ul>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to reach
out – I’m always here to help!<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">All the best, <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">{!Lead.OwnerFirstName}</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0.25in; background: white;"><br></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="margin-top:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:16.8pt;margin-left:
0in;line-height:16.8pt;background:white"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="background:white"><span class="fontSizeXSmall" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(50, 49, 48); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;">^<span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">NO PURCHASE OR DONATION NECESSARY. Void where prohibited and outside 50 U.S. and DC.  Open to legal residents of 50 U.S. states and DC, age 18+ (19+ in NE and AL; 21+ in MS) at entry. Begins 12:00 AM ET on 01/01/25; ends 11:59 PM ET on 01/26/25. To enter, either present to donate blood at an American Red Cross blood donation facility or send an email to&nbsp;</span></span><a href="mailto:customercare@redcross.org" style="color: rgb(164, 38, 44); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;"><span class="fontSizeXSmall" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 124, 175);">customercare@redcross.org</span></span></a><span class="fontSizeXSmall" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(50, 49, 48); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;"><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">&nbsp;and include the Giveaway name, "American Red Cross Super Bowl LIX Giveaway.” Limit of four (4) total Entries permitted per Entrant, regardless of method of entry. One (1) winner will receive one (1) trip for two (2) to attend Super Bowl LIX in New Orleans. ARV of all prizes: $9,500. Odds of winning depend on number of entries received. Full rules&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https://www.redcrossblood.org/local-homepage/events/super_bowl.html&amp;data=05%7c02%7cField%40redcross.org%7c55e5bea56f694cb7c53708dcfd213943%7cdd5b5d42c0d34ad2b5f160edb3af2771%7c0%7c0%7c638663566342814130%7cUnknown%7cTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7c0%7c%7c%7c&amp;sdata=13pdF/XVmbXurb0PiCWGVHYGtFmHoZgy4%2Bw8unTaKMg%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="color: rgb(164, 38, 44); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;"><span class="fontSizeXSmall" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4;"><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">click here</span></span></a><span class="fontSizeXSmall" style="font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(50, 49, 48); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;"><span style="color: rgb(33, 37, 41);">. Sponsor: American Red Cross. The prize shall not be sold on any internet site and any ticket that has been re-sold via the internet will be nullified. The National Football League’s licensed marks (“NFL”; “National Football League” and the NFL Shield design, “Super Bowl” and the Super Bowl LIX name) on any giveaway related materials have been reviewed by NFL and are used with permission. The NFL Entities have not offered or sponsored this giveaway in any way.</span></span></p><p></p>]]></td>
</tr>
